  "logline": "Elite online gamers command real human avatars in high-stakes scenarios through concealed earpieces. The tension: real-life players can disobey their controllers and follow gut instinct.",
  "detail": "A hybrid of competitive gaming, documentary, and scripted drama. The format interrogates control, obedience, and the gap between screen-based strategy and human unpredictability. Who is really in charge when the avatar starts thinking for themselves? Expanding across television and an NRC feature film.",
